<div class="mandarin-hanzi">多少</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">duōshao</div>

''Meaning:'' how many; how much  
''Part of speech:'' interrogative pronoun

!! In context
这本书多少钱？ — Zhè běn shū duōshao qián? — How much is this book?

!! Usage note
Used to ask about quantities or prices without presupposing a small answer. Unlike 几 (jǐ), it does not ordinarily require a following classifier. The second syllable is commonly neutral.
